Short: Chat system for TransAmiga BBS
Author: 
Uploader: rasa0011@fh-karlsruhe,de (Sami Radwan)
Type: comm/bbs

Description:

 ChatWizard is a complete chat replacement for TransAmiga BBS.
 It allows the user to communicate with the Sysop online.

Features:

- complete replacement for internal line chat
- new type of split screen chat
- free configurable yell-function
- and many more...
